libs/lua/effil-jit/
**/libs/effil/
**/libs/effil-jit/
**/libs/native/effil/

# PixelLib - C graphics library
# Re-fetch from: https://github.com/user/pixellib (or similar)
libs/c/pixellib/

# Raylib - C game development library
# Re-fetch with: git clone https://github.com/raysan5/raylib.git
libs/c/raylib/

# Lua source - install via system package manager
# Re-fetch with: apt install lua5.2 liblua5.2-dev (or download from lua.org)
RPG-autobattler/libs/lua/

# Love2D game framework - download from love2d.org
RPG-autobattler/libs/love2d/

# libharu PDF library - install via apt or build from source
# Re-fetch with: apt install libhpdf-dev (or git clone https://github.com/libharu/libharu)
words-pdf/libs/libharu-*/
words-pdf/libs/luahpdf/
words-pdf/backup-mvp/libs/libharu-*/

# CUDA toolkit - a vendor install, not our source
# Re-fetch with: the NVIDIA toolkit installer for your driver version
#
# This was committed by accident on 2026-07-22 and carried 3.8 GB in 5,050
# files, eleven of them past the 100 MB per-file ceiling GitHub rejects on -
# which blocked every push from that day until 2026-08-04, when the commits
# were rebuilt without it. Deleting the directory would not have been enough:
# the bytes live in whatever commit added them until that commit is remade.
# Kept ignored so a reinstall cannot walk it back in.
words-pdf/libs/cuda/

# AppImage binaries - download from project releases
*.AppImage

# C++ files - we only use C
*.cpp
*.hpp
*.cxx
*.cc

# LuaSocket - install via luarocks
# Re-fetch with: luarocks install luasocket
**/libs/luasocket/

